   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = f'(g(x)) \\cdot g'(x) \\). From the table, \\( g(3) = 1 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 1: \\( f'(1) = 3 \\).",
